# Google China Direct
# Small DIRECT set derived from ACL4SSR GoogleCN.list.
# Purpose: keep the small set of Google download / push / PKI / support endpoints
# that are commonly reachable directly in mainland China, while Google Search,
# Docs, Drive, YouTube and other Google services continue to follow FINAL.

